    <li>M3 Max can have <strong>up to 128 GB</strong> of usable memory in a laptop. RTX 4090 maxes at 24 GB. For memory-bound workloads on huge models, M3 Max wins by default.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Llama 7B Q4 — token generation</h2>
  <p>
    The most-run benchmark in local AI. Both platforms are capable.
  </p>

